Z||000003||Huck||06-25-2001||11:11 PM||||I did mine in a nice bright yellow. In my own opinion it looks pretty good.  I got some special interior paint that is ment for car interiors... plastic, vinyl, and fabric... I just did the instrument pannel, radio pod, shift console, and the cover over the computer plug and cigarette lighter..  I had a mack-tack type vinyl on it before, but it bubbled on me a bit after awhile, and didnt look as cool as the paint now does.<P>Lemme see if I have a pic....<BR> <IMG SRC="http://content.communities.msn.ca/_Secure/0MAAAAHcQSIMnALb6ZfHZ69!1*kuQb3f9VPO*5JGEq6IIZDVjkIG6YzMKXCMz*fb1YFnbHCzsPxQEAAAAWBMQAw/Image09.jpg"> <P>[img]http://content.communities.msn.ca/_Secure/0MAAAAHAQMYKeZtPScgEKAlWDkChkCqN1cNjm4H7zKivlfvl7Bm*8j6AJTz6zisOAaA6gj*x0NBgEAAAAWBMRAw/Image11.jpg [/img]<P>Huck<BR>87 GT T-top||||reg||1
