Z||000006||Songman||06-26-2001||08:54 AM||||Aus,<P>I love your car being right hand drive and all but I have always wondered about the gas pedal. You must have to sit at a kinda funny angle because of the wheelwell.<P>I almost bought an AC Cobra one time. Obviously not a real one, but already running complete car. I had to sit at an angle with my legs kinda out toward the front wheel because of the huge transmission hump behind the big block. It was not comfortable. Also, the top of the windshield was somewhere between my eyes and the tip of my nose.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||1
